      "writtenOn": "2022-06-28T14:47:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is correct as-is, it\u0027s the bounds of the text in the text\u0027s coordinate space. There\u0027s the external complication that depending on the type of subrun, the coordinate space differs, but that should be representable entirely with the Transform that\u0027s stored in the DrawParams recording the subrun draw.",
