        "id": 5065
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-06-28T15:40:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s still not clear to me how to handle DirectMaskSubRuns. It seems like a super special case so adding general code to handle it may be a bit awkward. It might be simpler to add the delta transform to the SubRunData, set the bounds to the final device bounds, and set the kIgnoreTransform draw flag. Then when we generate the vertices we apply the delta transform.\n\nAlso I think I need to take the drawOrigin into account when setting the bounds, as that adds a pre-translation.\n\nWhich is a long way of saying I think the bounds might need to be the bounds of the SubRun after applying any params in the SubRunData.",
      "parentUuid": "ad3e56e7_a43af6aa",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 87,
        "startChar": 16,
